• What reversible joining techniques would maintain structural integrity while enabling non-expert disassembly?
• How can product architecture be simplified to reduce the number of fastening points and material combinations?
• Which components should be prioritized for user-accessible disassembly based on failure rates and recovery value?
• What visual or instructional systems could guide users through safe and effective disassembly processes?
• How can we minimize the tools required for disassembly without compromising product reliability?
• What material marking and documentation systems would support accurate material sorting after disassembly?